2. Implement `ch6_write_profile` and `ch6_read_profile` at the `-- implement` comments (60s last-write gate on primary for the writer; everyone else / expired writers read the replica). Re-apply with `psql -f ch6_profile_ryw.sql`, then:

```sql
-- reset lab state
TRUNCATE ch6_last_write;
UPDATE ch6_profiles SET bio = 'Engineer' WHERE user_id = 101;
UPDATE ch6_profiles SET bio = 'Designer' WHERE user_id = 202;
SELECT ch6_refresh_replica();

SELECT * FROM ch6_write_profile(101, 'Staff engineer');
SELECT * FROM ch6_read_profile(101);
-- expect: primary | 101 | Staff engineer

